@startuml seq-review-lifecycle
title <size:16><b>Sequence: Жизненный цикл отзыва</b></size>\n<color:#555>Завершение заказа → отзыв → обновление рейтинга (Eventual Consistency)</color>

skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor #455A64
    FontColor #1C2833
}
skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
    BorderColor #2E7D32
    FontColor #1B5E20
}
skinparam queue {
    BackgroundColor #F3E5F5
    BorderColor #6A1B9A
}
skinparam database {
    BackgroundColor #EDE7F6
    BorderColor #6A1B9A
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    BorderColor #FBC02D
    FontColor #4E342E
    BorderThickness 1.2
    roundcorner 6
}
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    ArrowThickness 1.4
    LifeLineBorderColor #90A4AE
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
    BoxBorderColor #B0BEC5
    BoxBackgroundColor transparent
    DividerBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
    DividerBorderColor #90A4AE
    GroupBorderColor #78909C
    GroupBackgroundColor transparent
    GroupHeaderFontColor #263238
    GroupHeaderFontSize 12
}

actor       "Покупатель"              as Buyer
actor       "Продавец"                as Seller
participant "API Gateway\n:5000"      as GW    #ECEFF1
participant "OrderService\n:5003"     as OS    #EDE7F6
participant "ReviewService\n:5004"    as RS    #FDEDEC
participant "CatalogService\n:5002"   as CS    #E8F5E9
participant "IdentityService\n:5001"  as IS    #EBF5FB
participant "NotificationService\n:5005" as NS #E0F7FA
participant "AnalyticsService\n:5006" as AS    #FFF3E0
queue       "RabbitMQ"                as MQ    #F3E5F5
database    "PostgreSQL\nreviews"     as PGRS  #FDEDEC
database    "PostgreSQL\ncatalog"     as PGCS  #E8F5E9
database    "PostgreSQL\npublic"      as PGIS  #EBF5FB

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Продавец: переводит заказ через статусы к Completed ==
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Seller -> GW  : POST /api/orders/{id}/confirm
GW     -> OS  : Seller JWT
OS     -> MQ  : <color:#6A1B9A>OrderStatusChangedEvent</color>{Confirmed}
MQ     -> NS  : → уведомление покупателю «Заказ подтверждён»

Seller -> GW  : POST /api/orders/{id}/ready
GW     -> OS  : Seller JWT
OS     -> MQ  : <color:#6A1B9A>OrderStatusChangedEvent</color>{ReadyForPickup}
MQ     -> NS  : → уведомление покупателю «Готов к самовывозу»

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Покупатель подтверждает получение ==
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Buyer -> GW  : POST /api/orders/{id}/complete
GW    -> OS  : Auth JWT
activate OS
OS    -> OS  : CompleteOrderCommand\nReadyForPickup → Completed\nINSERT OrderStatusHistory

OS    -> MQ  : <color:#6A1B9A>OrderCompletedEvent</color>\n{orderId, buyerId, sellerId, products[], total}
OS    -> MQ  : <color:#6A1B9A>OrderStatusChangedEvent</color>{Completed}
OS   --> Buyer: 200 OrderDto
deactivate OS

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Параллельная обработка OrderCompletedEvent ==
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

par Параллельная обработка OrderCompletedEvent
    MQ -> RS : <color:#B71C1C>consume OrderCompletedEvent</color>
    activate RS
    RS -> PGRS : INSERT OrderReviewPermission\n{orderId, buyerId, isUnlocked=true}
    note over PGRS
      Отзыв можно оставить только
      после завершения заказа.
      Проверяется в CreateReviewCommand.
    end note
    deactivate RS

    MQ -> NS : <color:#B71C1C>OrderCompletedEvent</color>\n→ уведомление покупателю\n«Получен! Оцените заказ»\n+ email (CanEmailOrder)

    MQ -> AS : <color:#B71C1C>OrderCompletedEvent</color>\n→ SellerSalesSummary{Daily,Weekly,Monthly}.TotalRevenue += total\n→ TopProduct.PurchaseCount++\n→ SellerLeaderboard
end

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Покупатель оставляет отзыв ==
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Buyer -> GW  : POST /api/reviews\n{orderId, subjectType=Seller, rating=5, comment}
GW    -> RS  : Auth JWT
activate RS
RS    -> PGRS : SELECT OrderReviewPermission WHERE orderId = ? AND isUnlocked = true
PGRS --> RS   : Разрешено

RS -> PGRS   : INSERT Review{orderId, reviewerId, subjectType, subjectId, rating, comment}

RS -> PGRS   : UPDATE RatingAggregates\n(AverageRating, ReviewCount, FiveStars++, ...)

RS -> MQ     : <color:#6A1B9A>ReviewCreatedEvent</color>\n{reviewId, subjectId=sellerId, rating, comment}
RS -> MQ     : <color:#6A1B9A>RatingAggregateUpdatedEvent</color>\n{subjectId=sellerId, subjectType=Seller, newAverage, reviewCount}
RS --> Buyer : 201 ReviewDto
deactivate RS

note over PGRS
  RatingAggregates — pre-computed:
  AverageRating = sum(ratings) / count
  Распределение: OneStar..FiveStar
  Инкрементальное обновление, без
  пересчёта всей истории.
end note

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Обновление денормализованных данных (Eventual Consistency) ==
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

par Параллельная обработка RatingAggregateUpdatedEvent
    MQ -> CS : <color:#B71C1C>RatingAggregateUpdatedEvent</color>
    activate CS
    CS -> PGCS : UPDATE SellerReadModels\nSET AverageRating = newAverage,\n    ReviewCount = reviewCount,\n    LastSyncedAt = now
    deactivate CS

    MQ -> IS : <color:#B71C1C>RatingAggregateUpdatedEvent</color>
    activate IS
    IS -> PGIS : UPDATE SellerReadModels\nSET AverageRating = newAverage,\n    ReviewCount = reviewCount
    deactivate IS

    MQ -> NS : <color:#B71C1C>ReviewCreatedEvent</color>\n→ уведомление продавцу\n«Новый отзыв: {rating}★ — {comment[:50]}»\n+ email (CanEmailReview)

    MQ -> AS : <color:#B71C1C>RatingAggregateUpdatedEvent</color>\n→ SellerRatingHistory\n→ PlatformDailySummary.NewReviews++
end

note over CS, IS
  Паттерн Local Read Model:
  CatalogService и IdentityService держат
  копию рейтинга у себя, чтобы не обращаться
  к ReviewService при каждом запросе товара
  или профиля продавца.
end note

@enduml
